        "description": "LIST PRODUCTS — Get the product catalogue\n\nReturns the business's products. Any authenticated user  \n(cashiers need to see products to sell). Defaults to active  \nproducts only.\n\nAUTH: Bearer access token (any role)\n\nQUERY PARAMS (all optional):  \nsearch → filter by name (e.g. ?search=cowbell)  \ncategoryId → filter by category  \nisActive → 'false' to see deactivated products  \n(default shows active only)\n\nRESPONSES:  \n200 → array of products (sorted by name)"
      },
      "response": []
    },
