        "description": "GET PRODUCT — Get one product by ID\n\nReturns a single product. Any authenticated user.\n\nAUTH: Bearer access token (any role)\n\nPATH PARAM:  \nid → the product's UUID\n\nRESPONSES:  \n200 → the product  \n404 → product not found (or not in your business)"
