        "description": "UPDATE PRODUCT — Edit a product\n\nUpdates a product. Owner/manager only. Send only the fields  \nyou want to change. You cannot change opening quantity here —  \nstock changes happen through sales and purchases.\n\nAUTH: Bearer access token (owner or manager)\n\nPATH PARAM:  \nid → the product's UUID\n\nBODY (all optional — send only what changes):  \n{  \n\"name\": \"string\",  \n\"sellingPrice\": number,  \n\"costPrice\": number,  \n\"minimumStockQty\": number,  \n\"unitOfMeasure\": \"string\",  \n\"sku\": \"string\",  \n\"categoryId\": \"uuid or null (null removes the category)\"  \n}\n\nRESPONSES:  \n200 → the updated product  \n404 → product or category not found  \n400 → validation error  \n401/403 → not authenticated / not owner-manager"
      },
      "response": []
    },
