        "description": "DEACTIVATE PRODUCT — Soft-delete a product\n\nSets the product to inactive (isActive = false). This is a  \nSOFT delete — the product is hidden from the catalogue but not  \nremoved, because past sales reference it. Owner/manager only.\n\nAUTH: Bearer access token (owner or manager)\n\nPATH PARAM:  \nid → the product's UUID\n\nRESPONSES:  \n200 → the deactivated product  \n404 → product not found  \n401/403 → not authenticated / not owner-manager"
      },
